{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08721","headline":"与元丹丘方城寺谈玄作 · 李白","name":"与元丹丘方城寺谈玄作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"茫茫大梦中，惟我独先觉。\n腾转风火来，假合作容貌。\n灭除昏疑尽，领略入精要。\n澄虑观此身，因得通寂照。\n朗悟前後际，始知金仙妙。\n幸逢禅居人，酌玉坐相召。\n彼我俱若丧，云山岂殊调。\n清风生虚空，明月见谈笑。\n怡然青莲宫，永愿姿游眺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08721.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08721","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}